.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/states

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Send chat state notifications to recipient during chat sessions, such as typing, paused, active, gone.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/states on|off

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBon|off\fR
.RS 4
Enable or disable sending of chat state notifications.
.RE
